<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Fortis buy of MeesPierson - source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Fortis buy of MeesPierson - source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has approved the acquisition of merchant bank MeesPierson NV by Belgian-Dutch insurance and banking group Fortis, a European Union source said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal was submitted for clearance on January 3 under the European Union's merger regulation which bans creation or strengthening of dominant positions.</p>
<p>Fortis, which is owned by Fortis AG and Fortis Amev NV, announced earlier this month it had sealed the takeover of MeesPierson from Dutch bank ABN AMRO for 2.5 billion guilders.</p>
</text>
